DESCRIPTION >
    Priced-token coverage for the dashboard header: the share of billable
    Agent Messages that carry a non-null `cost_usd`, plus the estimated-cost
    total for the window. `cost_usd` is null when the model is unpriced or token
    coverage is missing (ADR "Pricing and cost"), so this ratio is the
    data-quality signal the UI shows next to "estimated cost" — never "$ spent"
    (ADR "Honesty about cost"). Query-time over `agent_messages FINAL`, the same
    query-time-first launch path as the leaderboard/outlier pipes. The
    denominator is `role = 'assistant'` turns: user/system/tool turns never carry
    usage, so they can never be priced, and counting them would deflate coverage
    against a denominator that was never billable. This matches the billable
    scoping in `agent_priced_usage`. `message_count` (all roles) is also returned
    so the raw `count(cost_usd) / count(*)` form stays derivable. `org_id` is
    enforced via the JWT `fixed_params`.

NODE coverage
SQL >
    %
    WITH
        {{ Int64(start_time_ms, 0) }} AS start_ms,
        {{ Int64(end_time_ms, 0) }} AS end_ms,
        if(end_ms = 0, toDateTime64(now(), 3), fromUnixTimestamp64Milli(end_ms)) AS end_dt,
        if(start_ms = 0, end_dt - toIntervalDay(7), fromUnixTimestamp64Milli(start_ms)) AS start_dt
    SELECT
        count() AS message_count,
        countIf(role = 'assistant') AS billable_message_count,
        countIf(role = 'assistant' AND cost_usd IS NOT NULL) AS priced_message_count,
        if(
            billable_message_count = 0,
            CAST(NULL, 'Nullable(Float64)'),
            round(priced_message_count / billable_message_count, 4)
        ) AS coverage_pct,
        sum(cost_usd) AS estimated_cost_usd
    FROM agent_messages FINAL
    WHERE OrgId = {{ String(org_id, '') }}
        AND EventAt >= start_dt
        AND EventAt < end_dt
        AND EventAt >= now() - toIntervalDay({{ Int32(retention_days, 7) }})
        {% if defined(source) %}
        AND source = {{ String(source) }}
        {% end %}
        {% if defined(repo_fingerprint) %}
        AND repo_fingerprint = {{ String(repo_fingerprint) }}
        {% end %}

TYPE ENDPOINT
